          "id": "7e5cf7bdf8ffd57868edbafbe2279b5460f0d282",
          "message": "Use CT memcmp in crypto_sign_verify_internal\n\nThis has negligible impact on performance while improving\nreadability and provability.\n\nFor now, we still declassify the result of the verification,\nbut this may be further improved in the future.\n\nSigned-off-by: Hanno Becker <beckphan@amazon.co.uk>",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-03T18:01:52Z",
          "tree_id": "a28b4453d9d52276e506f312a1b0c37ef41c97b7",
