          "message": "Refactor: move basic test source into test/src/\n\n- This commit refactor the test suite by moving the basic functional and\n  test source files into the test/src/ directory.\n\n- The changes in this commit are:\n  - The main test list (ALL_TESTS) in test/mk/components.mk is broken\n    down into logical groups (BASIC_TESTS, ACVP_TESTS, BENCH_TESTS).\n  - The build logic is updated to locate the basic tests in test/src/,\n    while still finding acvp and bench tests in their original location.\n  - The include paths within the moved source files\n    (gen_KAT.c, test_mldsa.c, test_unit.c, test_alloc.c) are updated to\n    reflect their new related path.\n  - This commit also prepares for subsequent changes to move\n    benchmarking and ACVP test sources into their own dedicated\n    directories(acvp, bench).\n\nSigned-off-by: willieyz <willie.zhao@chelpis.com>",
