          "id": "b248d02db26f363823b74d04cb3fc441bb6ca320",
          "message": "C: Public Key from Secret Key function\n\nRefactor keygen to use a new function that derives\nt0 t1 tr pk from rho s1 s2 so that this function can\nalso be called by a utility function pk_to_sk that\ngenerates the pk given the sk.\n\nWe also include ct_memcmp for constant time comparison.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jake Massimo <jakemas@amazon.com>",
