          "id": "21eca089efa99011970c115a14cc7d011f318ac1",
          "message": "HOL-Light: Autogenerate constant tables for x86_64 NTT proof\n\n- Resolves https://github.com/pq-code-package/mldsa-native/issues/648\n\nSigned-off-by: Matthias J. Kannwischer <matthias@kannwischer.eu>",
