          "distinct": true,
          "id": "f6b1162feee2d8bc2e996d61c5ff042a735c567e",
          "message": "Consistently use mld_memcpy and mld_memset where possible\n\nThere have been a handful of leftover loops doing memcpy and memset manually.\nThis commit replaces the loops with mld_memcpy and mld_memset.\n\nThere are two notable cases that cannot be replaced: the copying of sm <-> m\nin crypto_sign() and crypto_sign_open() as those buffers may overlap and,\nhence, would require memmove.\nAs we currently don't rely on memmove anywhere else, I am hesistent to\nintroduce this stdlib dependency here.\n\nSigned-off-by: Matthias J. Kannwischer <matthias@kannwischer.eu>",
