          "id": "c4d64c643ab2345dae0970c3cdc69c536984406b",
          "message": "Add missing macro template in config.h\n\n- During PR #657, we found that two macro templates were missing:\nMLD_CONFIG_USE_NATIVE_BACKEND_FIPS202 and MLD_CONFIG_USE_NATIVE_BACKEND_ARITH.\n\n- This commit adds them, and run autogen to synchronizes the templates across all test configuration headers.\n\nSigned-off-by: willieyz <willie.zhao@chelpis.com>",
