          "id": "80162622f0539f24a7e693ec999130cea6024ff6",
          "message": "CI: Enable gcc15 tests on MacOS\n\ngcc15 on Arm MacOS finally got fixed in nixpkgs.\nThis commit updates nixpkgs-unstable, takes gcc15 from it,\nand enables gcc15 tests on MacOS in CI.\n\n- Ports https://github.com/pq-code-package/mlkem-native/pull/1447\n\nSigned-off-by: Matthias J. Kannwischer <matthias@kannwischer.eu>",
