          "message": "Inline NTT functions into poly.c to remove indirection\n\nRemove the extra level of indirection poly_ntt -> poly_ntt_c -> mld_ntt\nby inlining NTT implementation directly into poly_ntt_c. This eliminates\nthe need for separate ntt.c/ntt.h files and aligns with mlkem-native.\n\n- Move NTT helper functions from ntt.c to poly.c as static functions\n- Remove ntt.c and ntt.h files\n- Update poly.h to define MLD_NTT_BOUND and MLD_INTT_BOUND constants\n- Remove #include \"ntt.h\" from poly.c\n- Update CBMC proofs to reference poly.c instead of ntt.c\n\nSigned-off-by: willieyz <willie.zhao@chelpis.com>",
